@GosubResetWitchBook Path:System/System_ResetWitchBook Version:2

@BeginIf Expression:isDebugDirectJump
    @Gosub Path:Act01_Chapter01/Act01_Chapter01_TrialInit
    @HidePerspectiveStageScreen Index:1 Duration:0 Reset:true
    @ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay

@SetTrialTimer Time:1200
@HideUI UINames:ControlPanel AllowToggle:false
@ShowUI UINames:DebateUI

; ==============================================================================
; MARK: 12: 💬 嘘が成立する条件
; ==============================================================================
; ＠ト書き▼議論シーン1-12 嘘が成立する条件
; BGM変更：AccUhEarts(Vocal有)
@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_15_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

# Judge1-12-1

@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-First
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Effect
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Last
@ChangeTrialPauseMode Enable:false ProcessTimer:true

@HidePerspectiveStageScreen Index:1 Reset:true

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Normal1,ArmR5,ArmL5
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:假设蕾雅是凶手，<br>而至今为止的疑问<br>都可以用魔法<br>来解释的话……|#0101Trial12_Margo001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:69,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Normal1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:我认为她的魔法<br>需要全部满足以下<br>【三种条件】才可以。|#0101Trial12_Margo002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,51 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Smile1,ArmR5
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:第一个当然就是，<br>【平时就不会暴露<br>魅惑是个谎言】。|#0101Trial12_Margo003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Pensive1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Pensive_Open,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hanna Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:如果魔法的效果<br>相差得太远，<br>要掩饰这件事<br>就太麻烦了……|#0101Trial12_Hanna001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,51 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Smile1,ArmR5
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:而第二个<br>必须满足的条件……<br>那就是<br>【就算在面前做杀人准备<br>也没办法抵抗】……<br>|#0101Trial12_Margo004| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:69,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Default
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:很难想像，<br>面对正在做准备的凶手，<br>城崎诺亚没有做<br>任何的反抗。<br>……毕竟是有人从房间外<br>当面把她刺死的。|#0101Trial12_Nanoka001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:32,51 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Smile1,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:最后第三个条件，<br>那就是<br>让其他人<br>【经过凶杀现场时，<br>察觉不到其中的尸体】……|#0101Trial12_Margo005| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,52 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Normal1,ArmR8_1,ArmL8,Eyes1_Pensive_Open2,Mouth1_Normal_Open2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:可可和米莉亚<br>明明经过了尸体现场，<br>却没有往里面看一眼。|#0101Trial12_Meruru001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:31,51 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Normal1,ArmR8_1,ArmL8,Eyes1_Pensive_Open2,Mouth1_Normal_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:说不定，<br>这也许可以<br>用偶然<br>来解释……|#0101Trial12_Meruru002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:31,51 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Normal1,Option-ArmL-Off,ArmR2,ArmL2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……反过来讲，<br>如果能证明并非偶然，<br>那么莲见是凶手的意见<br>就有说服力了。|#0101Trial12_Alisa001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Smile1,ArmR3,ArmL3,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Smile_Closed,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:怎么样，艾玛。<br>能让这三样条件<br>成立的魔法……<br>究竟存不存在呢？|#0101Trial12_Margo006| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:31,51 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Pensive1,ArmR1,ArmL3,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open03,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Open01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:我的魔法<br>毫无疑问是【魅惑】。<br>让他人对我<br>稍微怀抱爱意……<br>就是这么没用的魔法。|#0101Trial12_Leia001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Surprised1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hanna Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"确、确实有过<br><link=\"Objection_01_01_12_01\">无法移开视线</link>，<br><link=\"Objection_01_01_12_02\">心怦怦直跳</link>的情况……！<br>盯着看的话<br><link=\"Objection_01_01_12_03\">脸也会发烫</link>……<br>|#0101Trial12_Hanna002|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:35,51 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Angry1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hanna Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:4
@PrintDebateText Text:这百分百就是<br>魅惑的魔法～！！|#0101Trial12_Hanna003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:35,51 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Smile1,ArmR3,ArmL8,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Glare_Open03,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Open02
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Miria Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:嗯嗯，<br>小蕾她长得<br>确实很漂亮啦……|#0101Trial12_Miria001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Surprised1,ArmR3,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Surprised_Lifeless01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Confused_Open,Angle01/Facial/Sweat>Sweat01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Miria Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:4
@PrintDebateText Text:……啊，我可没有<br>奇怪的意思哦？<br>只是按普通人的看法来讲哦？|#0101Trial12_Miria002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,52 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Smile1,ArmR3,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Pensive_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:我倒不觉得<br>是这样欸～？<br>真的是魅惑吗～？<br>太可疑了！|#0101Trial12_Coco001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:33,51 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Pensive1,ArmR5,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Smile_Closed,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Middle
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:只是对某些人很有效，<br>对某些人<br>没什么效果罢了。|#0101Trial12_Leia002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:68,53 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1,ArmR2,ArmL1,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open02,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Middle
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:比如说……<br>对已经有心上人的人<br>就不太有效。<br>可可你<br>有没有头绪呢？|#0101Trial12_Leia003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Surprised1,ArmR8,ArmL7,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Surprised_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Gross_Open,Angle01/Facial/Sweat>Sweat01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:4
@PrintDebateText Text:"哈、哈！？<br>虽、虽然我<br>有我推啦，<br>但这算不上<br>恋爱对象……！！<br>你、你说这话<br>有什么<br><link=\"Objection_01_01_12_04\">根据</link>吗！？|#0101Trial12_Coco002|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,51 Roll:-4

@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.EndDebate-First
